    </CompilerOptions>
    <Description Value="Report Manager engine for Free Pascal (non-visual): report model, expression evaluator, data access through Zeos, SQLdb (the FireDAC connections of Delphi: SQLite, PostgreSQL, MySQL/MariaDB, Firebird/InterBase, SQL Server, Oracle and ODBC) and text files, and export to PDF, SVG, HTML, CSV, plain text and the Report Manager metafile format. Home page: https://reportman.es"/>
